OL,3,GNEWSANew hope that swimmers could
OL,4,Areturn to old lido
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to revamp a dilapidated 1930s
OL,7,Flido have returned to the surface,
OL,8,Fafter a council managed to resecure the
OL,9,Fbuilding's ownership and obtain rights
OL,10,Fto the architectural designs.
OL,12,FBroomhill Lido in Ipswich was leased to
OL,13,FFusion Lifestyles by the borough
OL,14,Fcouncil and it had been trying to bring
OL,15,Fthe site back into use, but the company
OL,16,Ffell into administration in April.
OL,18,FThe council will need to find new
OL,19,Ffunding for the restoration to take
OL,20,Fplace, as previous grants awarded to
OL,21,Frevive the pool have since been
OL,22,Fwithdrawn.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
