OL,3,GNEWSANew hope that swimmers could
OL,4,Areturn to old lido
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeil MacDonald, leader of the
OL,7,FLabour-run authority, said: "It's an
OL,8,Ficon of Ipswich and we hope to bring it
OL,9,Fback into use for people to swim [in]."
